[h2]Build 0.9.28[/h2]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Outline gap at the inside corner of L-shaped tables, desks and planter boxes.[/b] Where a dragged shape turned a corner, the two black outlines stopped short of each other and left a bare edge. The outline now turns the corner cleanly in any shape: L, T, U or cross.
[*]The planter box's timber rim now carries round inside corners too, so the bed reads as one piece.
[/list]
[list]
[*]No gameplay changes. Safe to update mid-save.
[/list]
